# The design window's kept place (mitcad#1710, GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#283),
# a start with a kept place that is not on the screens now (the test writes
# it into the settings: on a monitor no longer connected, half off the
# screen with its title bar above the top, or larger than the screen): the
# window is moved, and made smaller where needed, wholly into the primary
# screen's available area.
# Run by tools/ui-window-place-test.sh and
# tools/ui-windows-window-place-test.ps1.
expect-ever '^Window place restored: .*, moved onto the screen from ' 10
wait-idle
expect-window-state normal
expect-window-on-screen
